80 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (The University of Rizal System \(URS\), through the Office of the Vice President for Research and Development, and Extension \(OVPRDE\), shall conduct the 20th University Research and Development, and Extension \(RDE\) Congress as the University's annual venue for showcasing quality research and extension initiatives undertaken by its faculty members and personnel. The Congress aims to promote scholarly excellence by providing opportunities for researchers and extensionists to present their completed works, receive expert evaluation, and exchange knowledge and best practices.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
81 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (The Congress shall serve as the University's platform for selecting the best research papers under the descriptive, and developmental research categories, identifying the best extension projects, and recognizing outstanding electronic poster presentations for both research and extension. It likewise aims to recognize the notable achievements and significant contributions of faculty researchers and extensionists in advancing the University's research and extension agenda.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
82 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (In recognition of exemplary scholarly accomplishments, the proponents of the First-Place winning entries shall receive their awards during the Program and Awards and Incentives for Service Excellence \(PRAISE\) Awarding Ceremonies, while the Second Place and Third Place winners shall be recognized and awarded during the conduct of the 20th University Research, Development, Extension and Production Congress. Through this initiative, the University continues to foster a culture of excellence, innovation, and commitment to quality research and transformative extension services.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
